{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_7000_situation", "source_sha256": "a2db09fc462c15e5505d5cb90b588f513802adf08744c624880b07bd7b551460", "ja": "グラビア撮影", "zh": "写真拍摄", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_7000_place", "source_sha256": "f1860edaa8a9578fc2484c89f70aff5f4be5b8e448a9efe39fa4812250ca02c2", "ja": "撮影スタジオ", "zh": "摄影棚", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_7001_p", "source_sha256": "1bbc75ef986d15659a06cf8fa849810857d60b708019e70c135ceffab211ab41", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の企画で\n海美はイエティに扮した姿で撮影をすることに……）", "zh": "（海美要为写真杂志《アイグラ！！》的企划，扮成雪怪进行拍摄……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_7002_029umi", "source_sha256": "d6d36fb9e0a6de6a60eb6f22d4d2445aa161c3e1914c07df392bf5de1bb03912", "ja": "イエティって雪山に住んでるモンスターなんだね。\n全身もふもふで、なんだか温かそうだよね～。", "zh": "原来雪怪是住在雪山里的怪物啊。\n全身毛茸茸的，感觉好像很暖和呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_7003_p", "source_sha256": "13281987f6458fb00ae722a2f00b2942ed619840a75a5c5b21ceb9fc5aab4ac5", "ja": "そうだな。きっと寒い場所で生きるためには、\nもふもふにならないとダメだったのかもしれないな。", "zh": "是啊。为了在寒冷的地方生存，它或许不得不变得毛茸茸的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_7004_029umi", "source_sha256": "722cc064cd1559a7724aa8ae1fc79275fd71c639a0461c3eaabdaff0d54b774b", "ja": "うん。手も足もムクムクで、少し動きにくいけど。\nでも、シュッとしてたら寒くなっちゃうし……。", "zh": "嗯。手和脚都毛茸茸的，虽然有点难活动。\n不过，要是很干瘪苗条的话就会变冷了嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_7005_029umi", "source_sha256": "06860082a270bd950233ad1c92dd1f76aff8b8ef6a0d0a3f6d0dd8e5a315c9bc", "ja": "ねえ、{$P$}？　イエティが寒い～\nってなった時、どうやって温まってるのかな？", "zh": "呐，{$P$}？雪人觉得冷～的时候，是怎么取暖的呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_7006_p", "source_sha256": "66b32ea9b98c0c2fe9511eab9b700d3c3a4a7c1277f8a7bb029851c0b5ec4724", "ja": "えっ？　イエティが温まる方法か、そうだな……。", "zh": "诶？至于雪人是怎么取暖的嘛，这个嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_7007", "source_sha256": "41113b634bf80b0743a3a4ac5738728c3952ba3776ac8719855a5266dfd39153", "ja": "たくさん動く！", "zh": "活动量很大！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_7008", "source_sha256": "3bbc753409a6b7b83af572766ad7a19177f3fad1a9a62111f12ae706e0535ff9", "ja": "いっぱい食べる！", "zh": "大吃一顿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_7200_p", "source_sha256": "092ef6e3fbc2015691f21be48eff630c44bf9d59e1df32443a99a605fdac6622", "ja": "たくさん動いて、身体を温めてるんじゃないかな。\nほら、激しい運動をすると熱くなるだろ？", "zh": "应该是在多活动身体来暖和起来吧。\n你看，剧烈运动之后身体不就变热了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_7201_029umi", "source_sha256": "400753b00fbbd02a210589635ba95f9d30746d812e2195d0cd5a1f4a400329ce", "ja": "なるほど～！　確かに、運動が一番いいかもね！\n仲間とおしくらまんじゅうとかしたら、楽しそうだし！", "zh": "原来如此～！确实，运动可能是最好的办法呢！\n要是和伙伴们一起玩挤来挤去，感觉也会很开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_7202_029umi", "source_sha256": "bb6e2d7d98f38c3541bdec6ba75f924c74ef85288d44eb30f53b8805ef463681", "ja": "{$P$}も、私とおしくらまんじゅう\nしちゃう？　一緒にポッカポカになっちゃおうよ♪", "zh": "{$P$}也要和我挤成一团\n取取暖吗？一起变得暖烘烘的吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_7300_p", "source_sha256": "092ef6e3fbc2015691f21be48eff630c44bf9d59e1df32443a99a605fdac6622", "ja": "たくさん動いて、身体を温めてるんじゃないかな。\nほら、激しい運動をすると熱くなるだろ？", "zh": "应该是在多活动身体来暖和起来吧。\n你看，剧烈运动之后身体不就变热了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_7301_029umi", "source_sha256": "af5064974c3b821351471fb6929e65b7570d4f301e61707474c36872b89fad0b", "ja": "そっか～。雪山の寒さを吹き飛ばすくらいの運動なんて\nイエティも頑張り屋さんだね☆", "zh": "原来如此～。为了用运动驱散雪山的寒冷，连雪怪都很努力呢☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_7302_029umi", "source_sha256": "b0ec1d72a7f369f0a1af3c0faa7763ae88f396efedfddb62f55c6e9576edf001", "ja": "よーし、私も負けないように、\nたっくさんポーズしちゃおうかな！　えへへ♪", "zh": "好～，为了不输给它，\n我也要摆好多好多姿势！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_7500_p", "source_sha256": "47c8d0922ae0a7fc94dd0984fff6bc49902696516fc8b654c8598569b4d93d19", "ja": "たくさん食べることで、暖を取ってるんじゃないか？\nお腹が膨れると、誰でも元気になるしな。", "zh": "说不定是靠多吃东西来取暖的吧？\n填饱了肚子，任谁都会精神百倍嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_7501_029umi", "source_sha256": "d363bb8591329904ac48a992bd33c0f6b5fbfe298b518a7601da4c101f8c8715", "ja": "うん！　ご飯食べると、心も体もポカポカするね。\nもしかして、いっぱい食べるから身体も大きいのかも！", "zh": "嗯！吃饭的话，心里和身体都会暖洋洋的呢。\n说不定就是因为吃得多，身体才长得这么壮吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_7502_029umi", "source_sha256": "38d6b03e87b421c43b48047d9897b8607673eea63e2fc152de93bfee3f7d9c97", "ja": "私もイエティになりきるためにたくさん食べようかな？\nうん。撮影前だけど、お弁当食べてくるねー！", "zh": "我也要为了彻底变成雪人而多吃一点吗？\n嗯，虽然马上就要拍摄了，但我先去吃便当啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_7600_p", "source_sha256": "47c8d0922ae0a7fc94dd0984fff6bc49902696516fc8b654c8598569b4d93d19", "ja": "たくさん食べることで、暖を取ってるんじゃないか？\nお腹が膨れると、誰でも元気になるしな。", "zh": "说不定是靠多吃东西来取暖的吧？\n填饱了肚子，任谁都会精神百倍嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_7601_029umi", "source_sha256": "93204af6239bfc880ea0c8f3b329d4141a267d11b163df6ae47262105103e88b", "ja": "うんうん、たくさん食べると温かくなるよね！\nでも、雪山ってそんなにいっぱい食べ物があるのかな。", "zh": "嗯嗯，吃很多东西就会暖和起来呢！\n不过，雪山上真的有那么多食物吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_029umi_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_029umi_7602_029umi", "source_sha256": "66e4d2c144017e5e2845b23a6ead5f343ec4ad96c4f1fd503b453ccd24f6bc70", "ja": "量もたくさん必要だと思うし……。\nもしかして、野生の勘みたいなのがあるのかな～！", "zh": "我觉得也需要很多食物才行……难道说，是有什么类似野兽直觉的东西吗～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
